  "view": "<div :class=\"getStyles()\" role=\"document\" x-data=\"Challenge\" x-init=\"id = 74; max_attempts = 100; attempts = 0\">\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <div class=\"modal-body py-4 px-4 px-sm-5\">\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close float-end\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n\n        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n          <li class=\"nav-item\">\n            <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-target=\"#challenge\" @click=\"showChallenge()\">\n              Challenge\n            </button>\n          </li>\n\n          \n            \n            <li class=\"nav-item\">\n              <button class=\"nav-link challenge-submissions\" data-bs-target=\"#submissions\" @click=\"showSubmissions()\">\n                \n              </button>\n            </li>\n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"tab-content\">\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"challenge\">\n            <h2 class=\"challenge-name text-center pt-3\">\n              Cereal Killer 04\n            </h2>\n            <h3 class=\"challenge-value text-center\">\n              250\n            </h3>\n\n\n            \n              <div class=\"challenge-tags text-center pt-2 pb-3\">\n                \n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">TheZeal0t</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">reverse engineering</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              <p>@TheZeal0t</p>\n\n            </small>\n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><iframe src=\"\" style=\"background-image: url('https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/img/wayfinder/cerealkiller04.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\n<sup>Created By: <code>@TheZeal0t</code></sup>\n<p>We have a new set of Spooky Cereals this year, in honor of our New Visitors, who have traveled so long and far to come visit us and to share their other-worldly wisdom with us!</p>\n<p>Finally, we have the Greys. Everyone is very familiar with them, primarily because of Hollywood. Big eyes, big bulbous heads with skinny bodies... tiny little mouths and long, spindly fingers. You get the picture.</p>\n<p>Unlike the rest of our Far-Flung Friends, the Greys communicate with each other using &quot;Assembly Codes&quot;. This has led some to speculate that they are actually biologic meat-puppets that are remotely piloted. Lytton Labs hasn't quite figured out how to talk to them... which is very unfortunate, because they kind of like to ... probe ... their &quot;guests&quot;, and they don't seem to pick up on English, such as, &quot;OW, that @#$@#%^^ HURTS!!!&quot;</p>\n<p>We have recovered a binary from one of their crashed ships, and we'd like you to analyze it. Once we figure out their favorite spooky cereal, we feel like we can better bond with our new friends!</p>\n<p>Submit the answer as <code>deadface{I-For-One-Welcome-Our-New-Buggy-Overlords}</code> ... which is not the REAL FLAG, by the way.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/yds6ucbs\">Download Windows 64-bit Binary</a>(14KB)<br>\n<sup>SHA256: <code>045f72d2027c0c9397d136375341b4c5d6b9bb6765a73aa75fd3955bbef2f96f</code></sup></p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> tentatives\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-8\">\n                \n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                      value=\"74\"\n                  >\n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\"\n                      type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                      @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                      placeholder=\"Flag\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                  >\n                \n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-4 mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n                \n                  <button\n                      id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                      class=\"challenge-submit btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                      @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                  >\n                    Soumettre\n                  </button>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <template x-if=\"response\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                      :class=\"{\n                        'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                        'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                        'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                        'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                      }\" role=\"alert\"\n                  >\n                    <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                    <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                      <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                        <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                          Challenge suivant\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                      <div>\n                        <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                          Partager\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </template>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"submissions\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Submission</th>\n                    <th>Type</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-submission-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"submission in submissions\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td x-data=\"{ truncate: true }\">\n                        <code x-text=\"truncate ? '*'.repeat(submission.provided.length) : submission.provided\"></code>\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-link p-0 pl-1\" @click=\"truncate = !truncate\">\n                          <i :class=\"truncate ? 'fas fa-eye' : 'fas fa-eye-slash'\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.type\"></td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solves\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Nom</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-solves-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"solve in solves\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>\n                        <a :href=\"solve.account_url\" x-text=\"solve.name\"></a>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"solve.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solution\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"challenge-solution-content pt-3\">\n                  <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                    <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
